The '''Primordial Hatchling''' is a [[Mob]] that can spawn when fighting a {{SlayerTier|III}} or {{SlayerTier|IV}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}}.

== Spawning ==
During the {{SlayerTier|III}} and {{SlayerTier|IV}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} fight, it will use its '''Web of Lies''' ability at {{Red|66%}} and {{Red|33%}} {{Stat|Health}}. This will cause it to spawn 2 ({{SlayerTier|III}}) / 3 ({{SlayerTier|IV}}) eggs sacs above it, with {{Hp|3}} ({{SlayerTier|III}}) / {{Hp|6}} ({{SlayerTier|IV}}). If the eggs aren't shot down in time, they will hatch into a '''Primordial Hatchling'''.

== Behavior ==
'''Primordial Hatchlings''' run towards the player to attack them.

